{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lean Left, Lean Right\u00a0\u2014\u00a0Without pressing any keys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiltility, the utility to tilt, is a desktop app that uses your <strong>webcam</strong> and <strong>pose estimation models</strong> to detect:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd04 <strong>Head tilts</strong> \u2014 left and right tilts trigger keyboard keys or controller buttons in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270b <strong>Hand gestures</strong> \u2014 up to <strong>13 recognizable gestures</strong> can each be bound to keys or controller inputs</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything runs <strong>locally on your machine</strong>, no cloud, no data sent anywhere. Tiltility is developed in Germany \ud83c\udde9\ud83c\uddea and is 100% GDPR compliant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/85b3017e88e3e62df0a06bae520bbf35.poster.avif?t=1773998630\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/85b3017e88e3e62df0a06bae520bbf35.webm?t=1773998630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/85b3017e88e3e62df0a06bae520bbf35.mp4?t=1773998630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Feel Every Lean \u2014 True Immersion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn natural head tilts into in\u2011game lean. Sneak, peek, and strafe with your body \u2014 no keys required.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for tactical FPS lean mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use hand gestures as commands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Natural movement that feels right</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works with standard webcams</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/4e7299e8ba4aba4405b19abf4bf8b991.poster.avif?t=1773998630\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/4e7299e8ba4aba4405b19abf4bf8b991.webm?t=1773998630\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/extras/4e7299e8ba4aba4405b19abf4bf8b991.mp4?t=1773998630\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >No Internet? No Problem.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything runs locally on your PC for minimal latency and maximum reliability \u2014 even offline.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No cloud processing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Low latency for competitive play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private by design</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Works With Any Game, Any Genre</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From shooters and RPGs to racing and sims \u2014 bind movements to any keys and keep your flow.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No mods, overlays, or SDKs needed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bind to Q/E, or any other key</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs alongside your favorite titles</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Compatible With Steam Input</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate Tiltility\u2122 companion virtual controller to emulate inputs for more actions.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pair with Steam Input for better compatibility</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add gestures for quick actions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More control without clutter</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Disclaimer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiltility\u2122 utilizes machine learning technology. While powerful, ML models are not 100% accurate and can produce unexpected or incorrect results. This software is provided for <strong>entertainment purposes only</strong> and should not be used in professional, medical, legal, or high-stakes environments where absolute precision is required.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Credits:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music by Audionautix</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4058970?t=1773998630","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/ed2eb54d519d7cb8ae2ed1aa7ceff32281403d1b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773998630","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/2aac3cccaaf5b51e6fd3e54a9e82e062aad696f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773998630","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4058970/2aac3cccaaf5b51e6fd3e54a9e82e062aad696f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773998630","categories":[{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4324950,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lean Left, Lean Right\u00a0\u2014\u00a0Without pressing any keys!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiltility, the utilit